                    Japan by the Japanese Minister for Foreign Affairs on July 8, <ref
                        target="frus1931-41v02#pg_503">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, Japan, 1931–1941, Vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">ii</hi>, pp. 503</ref>, <ref
                        target="frus1931-41v02#pg_504">504</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d831-f3" n="29" xml:id="d831-f3-content">
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg201">pp. 201</ref> and <ref
                        target="#pg254">254</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
